U-Boot loader and related files for the FriendlyELEC NanoPi-R5C

To install this bootloader on an sdcard or eMMC just do:

dd if=/usr/local/share/u-boot/u-boot-nanopi-r5c/idbloader.img of=/path/to/device seek=64 bs=512 conv=sync
dd if=/usr/local/share/u-boot/u-boot-nanopi-r5c/u-boot.itb of=/path/to/device seek=16384 bs=512 conv=sync
